1f:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10 max-w-3xl space-y-5 text-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/85 sm:text-lg","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"Many engagements do not fit neatly under a single pillar from the outset, and that is normal rather than a sign the requirement needs to be split up before reaching out. A request to 'improve our security' might turn out to be a network segmentation problem, an identity problem, or a monitoring gap once assessed — and a request to 'add AI to our product' often surfaces a data-access or infrastructure question before the application work can start."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Start with whichever pillar most closely matches the immediate problem; scoping the rest is part of the first conversation, not a prerequisite for having it."}]]}]
